# termiHub agent self-update signing key (AGT-005, #3213).
#
# TERMIHUB-AGENT-UPDATE-KEY-PLACEHOLDER
#
# This file is a PLACEHOLDER: no real signing key has been generated yet. While it
# contains no PUBLIC KEY block, a release-built agent trusts NO key and therefore
# refuses EVERY self-update (fail closed), and release.yml refuses to publish.
#
# The maintainer replaces this file by running (once):
#
#   ./scripts/internal/setup-agent-signing-key.sh
#
# which generates an ed25519 keypair, stores the private key ONLY as the
# AGENT_UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY GitHub Actions secret, and rewrites this file with the
# public key in PEM (SubjectPublicKeyInfo) form. See docs/contributing.md →
# "Agent update signing key".
